        "printedPages": [
          60
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t02-mother-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "母题精讲 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t02-mother-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25广东）父子两人在百米赛道上匀速跑步，两人从赛道起点同时出发，父亲跑到终点时，儿子距离终点还有40米，若父亲立即折返跑向赛道起点，则两人相遇时，儿子距离终点还有（）米。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "35"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "30"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "25"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "15"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "C",
        "sourceAnswer": "C"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          66
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          60
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s06-t02-mother-01-p066.webp",
            "alt": "行程问题（一） · 母题精讲1 · 讲义第60页",
            "pdfPage": 66
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t02-mother-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s06-t02-mother-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：C"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先从父亲到终点的时刻看速度比：同一时间父亲跑100米，儿子跑60米，所以速度比5∶3。父亲折返时，两人相距40米。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "接下来相向而行，儿子分到40×3/(5＋3)＝15米，跑到75米处，离终点还有25米，选C。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "先用同时间路程求速度比，再按速度比分掉相向靠近的间距。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
