    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s06-t02-mother-02-explanation-02",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析 · 2",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s06-t02-mother-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们用速度差求前段时间前，必须知道初始间距；提速后的追赶时间不能自行补出同起点条件。"
        }
      ],
